WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:09.530
I'm coming to the end of my long term as
a district councillor. I was first elected

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:14.300
in 1995 and I'm often asked would I do
it all over again and I certainly would.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:19.849
I think it's been an amazing experience
for me personally and also you feel you

00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:23.810
might have made a small difference here
and there. You will get a great deal of

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.429
support from officers at the council and
I'm still learning although I'm in this

00:00:28.429 --> 00:00:33.980
final year as a counselor, I'm retiring
next May. I'd like to support all of you

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:38.390
who are considering standing, whatever
political party or none, because you will

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.630
make a difference.
There will be frustrations but mostly

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:45.830
you will be in the thick of it. You will
be doing your best to assist people.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:50.690
Would also be involved in many major
decisions that district councils have

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:55.880
to go through and I wish everybody well.
I know it's been an excellent

00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:00.770
opportunity for me in my life, and I know
with the supportive staff of the council -

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:04.850
you'll have inductions you'll have an
awful lot of training and you will have

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:09.520
considerable support throughout your
time.

